The relation for double disk: 
```
def doubleDiskRel (n : ℕ) : Disk(n+1) ⊕ Disk(n+1) → Disk(n+1) ⊕ Disk(n+1) → Prop :=
  fun p q => p = q ∨
    (∃ d e, p = Sum.inl d ∧ q = Sum.inr e ∧ d = e ∧ (d : E (n+1)) ∈ Metric.sphere (0:E(n+1)) 1) ∨
    (∃ d e, p = Sum.inr d ∧ q = Sum.inl e ∧ d = e ∧ (d : E (n+1)) ∈ Metric.sphere (0:E(n+1)) 1)
```

