- **`doubleDiskQuotHomeoSphere (n) : Quot (doubleDiskRel n) ≃ₜ Sphere (n+1)`** — the gluing lemma for sphere recognition: **`Sⁿ⁺¹ = Dⁿ⁺¹ ∪_{Sⁿ} Dⁿ⁺¹`**.
